				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13506948/wolf-hollow#post-4721690</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2020 04:35:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>SilentWatcher</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5399549</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is probably the weakest Parawatch entry to date, to be honest. The first few posts did give me chills, especially the first anecdote about Pepper. But like a lot of creepypastas, this one built up expectations that it couldn’t keep. The final post, supposedly the apex of the spookums, seemed tranquil and oddly poetic, not really scary. It felt like huge letdown, and a lot of questions that could be answered while improving the scare factor were just completely ignored.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
