l" >Pikecell</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-habsburg" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6607675&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594348973" alt="J Habsburg" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6607675)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-habsburg" >J Habsburg</a></span> for looking a this once. A special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2812984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594348973" alt="AbsentmindedNihilist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2812984)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" >AbsentmindedNihilist</a></span> for looking at the first version of this and giving the advice to focus on the dog.</p> <p><strong>Image Source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_and_dogs_at_Ross_Lake_Resort,_circa_1990_(48876285247).jpg">Man and dogs at Ross Lake Resort, circa 1990</a>, CC BY-SA 2.0</p> 
